 {
  "title": "Rethinking the founder plan",
  "create_time": 1709413200.0,
  "conversation_id": "14eda9f6-3a9a-57c0-a37a-2646a7069f32",
  "current_node": "14b0eabe-3b09-5085-95f2-64d77f6b40bf",
  "mapping": {
   "b064c4da-7212-5085-a614-7af5d3cdd795": {
    "id": "b064c4da-7212-5085-a614-7af5d3cdd795",
    "message": null,
    "parent": null,
    "children": [
     "4dc0060c-dbde-5ffd-834d-c72a784a3302"
    ]
   },
   "4dc0060c-dbde-5ffd-834d-c72a784a3302": {
    "id": "4dc0060c-dbde-5ffd-834d-c72a784a3302",
    "parent": "b064c4da-7212-5085-a614-7af5d3cdd795",
    "children": [
     "95ea2988-ffe2-5732-b689-11f6fc64bb2b"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "4dc0060c-dbde-5ffd-834d-c72a784a3302",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "create_time": 1709413200.0,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "I keep telling myself I want to start my own company, but when I actually picture the day to day I don't want the sales calls or the hiring. I think what I like is being the person who figures out how the thing works and then makes it run. My dad always said real work means being your own boss and I think I absorbed that without ever checking whether it fit me."
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "95ea2988-ffe2-5732-b689-11f6fc64bb2b": {
    "id": "95ea2988-ffe2-5732-b689-11f6fc64bb2b",
    "parent": "4dc0060c-dbde-5ffd-834d-c72a784a3302",
    "children": [
     "915411dc-e8b1-548c-b4df-7da38a56dfc5"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "95ea2988-ffe2-5732-b689-11f6fc64bb2b",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "create_time": 1709413260.0,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "What do you like about the work itself?"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "915411dc-e8b1-548c-b4df-7da38a56dfc5": {
    "id": "915411dc-e8b1-548c-b4df-7da38a56dfc5",
    "parent": "95ea2988-ffe2-5732-b689-11f6fc64bb2b",
    "children": [
     "949d3532-b7a9-5f78-9a47-82a7314d1bf9"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "915411dc-e8b1-548c-b4df-7da38a56dfc5",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "create_time": 1709456520.0,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "Okay I slept on it. I think the honest version is that I like hard problems and I like being trusted with them, and none of that requires owning the business. I'm going to stop pitching myself as a future founder in interviews because I don't believe it and people can tell."
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "949d3532-b7a9-5f78-9a47-82a7314d1bf9": {
    "id": "949d3532-b7a9-5f78-9a47-82a7314d1bf9",
    "parent": "915411dc-e8b1-548c-b4df-7da38a56dfc5",
    "children": [
     "586bcc2c-1378-5aa3-9e37-5f97e558457c"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "949d3532-b7a9-5f78-9a47-82a7314d1bf9",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "create_time": 1709456580.0,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "That's a clear distinction."
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "586bcc2c-1378-5aa3-9e37-5f97e558457c": {
    "id": "586bcc2c-1378-5aa3-9e37-5f97e558457c",
    "parent": "949d3532-b7a9-5f78-9a47-82a7314d1bf9",
    "children": [
     "14b0eabe-3b09-5085-95f2-64d77f6b40bf"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "586bcc2c-1378-5aa3-9e37-5f97e558457c",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "create_time": 1710093840.0,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "Coming back to this a week later. I told my manager I want the technical lead track, not the management track, and it felt right saying it out loud. My fear was that I'd be settling, but I think I was confusing ambition with a specific costume of ambition."
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
